// Code coverage for the CHERIoT memory subsystem block-level bench: the subsystem (`cheriot_mem_sys` and
// below: tag filters, RMW filter, access checkers, TBRE, CSRs) and nothing of the testbench.
// Built with -covdut cheriot_mem_sys.
//
// Same scheme as ../cheriot-rtos-test-suite/dv/cov/cheriot_rtos_cover.ccf: the suite-specific additions
// come first, then the shared ../coverage/ibex_cover.ccf, so its black-boxing of the pre-verified
// prims (prim_alert_sender, prim_secded_*, ...) and its assertion-only treatment of tlul_assert
// apply here as well. Its ibex_top selection matches nothing in this bench. The RTOS SoC covers the
// same RTL as cheriot_mem_subsys.u_cheriot; the two databases have different roots and are
// reported side by side, not merged.

deselect_coverage -betfs -module cms_tb...

select_coverage -befts -module cheriot_mem_sys...
// Toggle on the subsystem's ports only, as for the other roots
deselect_coverage -toggle -module cheriot_mem_sys...
select_coverage -toggle -module cheriot_mem_sys

include_ccf ${IBEX_ROOT_DIR}/dv/coverage/ibex_cover.ccf
